  "正在為這個交辦建立一支專屬部門並直接開工…": "Creating a dedicated department for this assignment and starting right away…",
  "無法自動建立專屬臨時部門（可能此工作區正在執行其他 Mission，或團隊規劃失敗）；可稍後再試，或關掉「專屬部門」改用既有部門路由。": "Could not auto-create a dedicated temporary department (this workspace may be running another Mission, or crew planning failed); try again later, or turn off \"dedicated department\" and route to an existing one.",
