  "原專屬部門已解散（伺服器重啟或已清理），正在重建一支專屬部門接手追問…": "The original dedicated department is gone (server restart or cleanup); rebuilding one to take the follow-up…",
  "無法為追問重建專屬部門（可能此工作區正在執行其他 Mission）；可稍後再試。": "Could not rebuild a dedicated department for the follow-up (this workspace may be running another Mission); try again later.",
