  "這是對已完成交辦的後續追問，請延續先前成果處理，不要從頭重做。\n【原交辦】{objective}\n【追問】{followUp}": "This is a follow-up to a completed assignment; build on the previous results instead of starting over.\n[Original assignment] {objective}\n[Follow-up] {followUp}",
