  "無法自動建立專屬部門（可能此工作區正在執行、人數已滿或規劃失敗），請手動建立部門後再交辦。": "Could not auto-create a dedicated department (the workspace may be busy, at capacity, or planning failed); create a department manually and assign again.",
  "已建立「{name}」，交給它繼續規劃與執行。": "Created \"{name}\"; it will continue planning and execution.",
  "「{title}」的 Mission 在重啟後遺失，已重新排入派工。": "The mission for \"{title}\" was lost across a restart; it has been queued for dispatch again.",
  "⛔ 自動循環已停止：代答次數已用完，這個問題需要你親自回答；回覆後可再打開開關。": "⛔ Autopilot stopped: stand-in answers are used up and this question needs you personally; reply, then switch it back on.",
  "⛔ 自動循環已停止：上一個交辦需要你處理或未成功；接手後可再打開開關。": "⛔ Autopilot stopped: the last assignment needs you or did not succeed; take over, then switch it back on.",
  "⛔ 自動循環已停止：{error}": "⛔ Autopilot stopped: {error}",
  "⛔ 自動循環已停止：決策模型無法給出下一步（{error}）。": "⛔ Autopilot stopped: the decision model could not produce a next step ({error}).",
  "⛔ 自動循環已停止：{reason}；接手後可再打開開關。": "⛔ Autopilot stopped: {reason}; take over, then switch it back on.",
  "🤝（自動接手代答，第 {n}/{max} 次，可隨時修正）{reply}": "🤝 (Auto-resume stand-in answer, {n}/{max} — you can correct it anytime) {reply}",
  "⛔ 自動循環已停止：自動接手失敗（{error}）。": "⛔ Autopilot stopped: auto-resume failed ({error}).",
