  "無法送出排隊訊息": "Could not send the queued message",
  "沒有等待恢復的工作": "No work is waiting to resume",
  "NPC 目前無法恢復此工作": "The NPC cannot resume this work right now",
  "此工作需等用量重置後才能繼續": "This work can continue only after the usage limit resets",
  "【重新啟動後繼續原任務】伺服器重啟前的原始指示如下。請先檢查目前對話與工作區的實際進度，避免重複執行；然後從未完成處繼續，完成後回報。\n\n{task}": "[Resume after restart] The original instruction from before the server restart is below. First check the conversation and workspace for actual progress to avoid repeating work; then continue from where it left off and report when done.\n\n{task}",
  "無法恢復工作": "Could not resume the work",
  "已停止恢復重啟前未完成的工作": "Stopped resuming the work left unfinished before the restart",
  "{name} 的 {provider} 尚未登入": "{name}'s {provider} is not signed in",
  "{objective} 正在使用這些 NPC，不能清空重開": "{objective} is using these NPCs; cannot clear and restart",
  "重開進行中的 Mission 時必須重建整個部門": "Restarting an in-progress Mission requires rebuilding the whole department",
  "背景代理任務超過 {minutes} 分鐘未回報完成，已暫停 Mission 等待你確認": "A background agent task went {minutes} minutes without reporting completion; the Mission is paused for your confirmation",
  "伺服器發生未預期的錯誤": "The server hit an unexpected error",
  "Mission 分工計畫必須包含 2 到 {max} 個步驟；系統會再加入最終彙整報告": "A Mission work plan needs 2 to {max} steps; the system appends the final consolidated report",
  "你是 Department Work 的部門主管。使用者是老闆與最終決策者；老闆已經用這次交辦授權部門依計畫開始工作，不需要再次核准一般分工。你負責依每位 NPC 的職務規劃、分工、接續與彙整。請只規劃，不要修改檔案。\nMISSION ID: {id}\nDEPARTMENT LEAD WORKER ID: {bossWorkerId}\nWORKSPACE: {workspace}\n老闆交辦目標: {objective}\n驗收條件: {acceptance}\n可指派的部門 NPC: {members}\n可分派的附件: {attachments}{discussionBlock}\n\n規則:\n- {policy}\n- 不要啟動背景 Agent；在同一回合直接完成規劃。\n- 依照每位 NPC 的 role 分派最符合其職責與專長的工作，不要把所有工作交給主管。\n- 自己判斷最小充分流程，不要為了看起來像協作而增加步驟。\n- 聚焦建議或調查：用 Quick Consult，第一步 consult 指派專家，第二步 execute 必須交回部門主管。\n- 檢查既有成果：用 Quick Review，第一步 review 指派專家，第二步 execute 必須交回部門主管。\n- 跨多個實作責任：用完整 Mission，從 execute 開始，review 必須緊接其 execute，且 Review 與前一 Execute 必須由不同 NPC 負責。\n- 產出 2 到 {maxPlanSteps} 個依序執行的分工步驟；系統會自動加入最終報告。assigneeWorkerId 必須逐字使用上方清單中的 id。\n- attachmentIds 只能使用上方附件 id，且只把該步驟真正需要的附件交給該成員。\n- Consult 與 Review 唯讀；Execute 負責實作或由部門主管根據快速協作結果接續完成。\n- 權限、認證、重大取捨與無法確認的事項必須留給老闆決定。\n- 任務應能在不自動進行 Git release 操作的情況下完成。\n\n最後只能以這個標記回傳結構化計畫：\n<department_mission_plan>{\"summary\":\"說明分工依據與為何選 Quick 或 Mission\",\"steps\":[{\"title\":\"\",\"objective\":\"\",\"kind\":\"execute|review|consult\",\"assigneeWorkerId\":\"\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"attachmentIds\":[]}]}</department_mission_plan>": "You are the department lead for Department Work. The user is the boss and final decision maker; by assigning this work the boss has already authorized the department to proceed per plan, so routine division of labour needs no further approval. You plan, assign, sequence, and consolidate according to each NPC's role. Plan only — do not modify files.\nMISSION ID: {id}\nDEPARTMENT LEAD WORKER ID: {bossWorkerId}\nWORKSPACE: {workspace}\nBoss objective: {objective}\nAcceptance criteria: {acceptance}\nAssignable department NPCs: {members}\nAssignable attachments: {attachments}{discussionBlock}\n\nRules:\n- {policy}\n- Do not launch background agents; finish planning in this same turn.\n- Assign each NPC the work that best matches its role and expertise; do not give everything to the lead.\n- Choose the minimal sufficient flow yourself; do not add steps just to look collaborative.\n- Advice or investigation focus: use Quick Consult — step one consult assigned to a specialist, step two execute must return to the department lead.\n- Checking existing results: use Quick Review — step one review assigned to a specialist, step two execute must return to the department lead.\n- Multiple implementation responsibilities: use a full Mission starting from execute; each review must directly follow its execute, and the Review must be handled by a different NPC than that Execute.\n- Produce 2 to {maxPlanSteps} sequential steps; the system appends the final report automatically. assigneeWorkerId must use the ids above verbatim.\n- attachmentIds may only use the attachment ids above, and give each member only the attachments that step truly needs.\n- Consult and Review are read-only; Execute implements, or the department lead follows up on quick-collaboration results.\n- Permissions, credentials, major trade-offs, and anything unverifiable must be left to the boss.\n- The task should be completable without performing Git release operations automatically.\n\nReturn the structured plan only inside this marker:\n<department_mission_plan>{\"summary\":\"why this split and why Quick or Mission\",\"steps\":[{\"title\":\"\",\"objective\":\"\",\"kind\":\"execute|review|consult\",\"assigneeWorkerId\":\"\",\"acceptanceCriteria\":[],\"attachmentIds\":[]}]}</department_mission_plan>",
  "\n上次輸出被拒絕的原因：{problem}\n請針對這個原因修正。": "\nWhy the last output was rejected: {problem}\nFix exactly that.",
  "你已完成工作，但輸出缺少必要的結構化格式。這是唯一一次格式修復。\n不要使用工具、不要啟動 Agent、不要重做分析，也不要修改檔案。只把下方既有結論整理成合法 JSON 並包在指定標記內。\n指定格式：{contract}{problemLine}\n\n既有輸出：\n{priorOutput}": "You finished the work, but the output is missing the required structured format. This is the only format repair. Do not use tools, launch agents, redo the analysis, or modify files. Just reshape the existing conclusion below into valid JSON wrapped in the specified marker.\nRequired format: {contract}{problemLine}\n\nExisting output:\n{priorOutput}",
  "本機診斷已關閉": "Local diagnostics are disabled",
