  "這是使用者明確設定的目前目標；除非使用者更新或清除它，請讓後續工作持續朝它推進。": "This is the user's explicitly set active goal; keep subsequent work advancing toward it until the user updates or clears it.",
  "【成品匣 / OUTBOX】交付最終成品（報告、圖表、匯出文件、打包程式等）時，把完成的檔案放進工作區根目錄的 outbox/ 資料夾（不存在就先建立）。放進去的檔案會直接出現在使用者的「成品匣」面板，一鍵開啟。": "[OUTBOX] When delivering final products (reports, charts, exported documents, packaged builds), put the finished files into the outbox/ folder at the workspace root (create it if missing). Files placed there appear directly in the user's Outbox panel, one click to open.",
  "只放能直接交付的最終版本；中間過程檔、暫存檔不要放。檔名用一眼能懂的描述性名稱。": "Only put directly deliverable final versions there; no intermediate or temp files. Use descriptive file names that are clear at a glance.",
